    "rating": 4.7,
    "reference": "ChIJ0WAyTVVJyUwRWD9JAzvsxFc",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kimberly Rodgers",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103371620509773729519/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL5HhQBGOhsBe8LYlsODhTPWIo1rk5GehQNi3Wq_TcN1pxLwQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Absolutely terrible customer service. I bought a battery from them 6 months ago with a lifetime guarantee. My battery is completely dead & won’t even boost. I came back the first day & asked to pay for a new battery & then come bring the old one back to exchange under warranty. They refused, and told me to come back with the original battery. I returned back less than 12 hours later, and now the claimed they don’t have my battery anymore. They offered to provide a credit, but REFUSED to assist to find another location that had my battery in stock. The associate claimed that they had too many customers, in a store that was entirely empty. Dishonest business with 0 client service. Dont waste your money here unless you want to be scammed.",
        "time": 1769889787,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ali Hamadi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110458948868904401255/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUdRII2cy_TfzczDy5kPzL4II9UA4aEjTKHOciXSxwS03ILy5AnaQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Got scammed when I bought a battery. They give you back 25$ when you bring back the old one but 25$ in gift card. Who would want a gift card from a scrap yard ?  I go to a scrap yard once in a blue moon. If someone pays cash you give him back the money cash.",
        "time": 1768957369,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Josh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112163340406587946972/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK1MEuIADKXTvjQTNDPqrU0Kyo0V2-JdsMgWCjI1UaBoYhnXg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "They close at 4pm. Not 5pm.\nIf you come after 4pm they will not let you into the scrap yard.\n\nI went with a friend yesterday because I needed a coil pack for a 2004 Honda Accord something that is literally 5 minutes to remove and the older guy with grey hair was just being rude and sarcastic. He was just complaining about his job and how he doesn’t want to work and told me to leave because there closed but it was only 4pm. Either update the closing time to 4pm or update your staff.\n\nMind as well order it from Amazon since it will come tomorrow and not much more expensive to just buy new.",
        "time": 1763066779,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Filipe Pedrosa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114296230651395104918/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMdOnQwG5KMggMFLXoZ393d7vvPn4DZP64p4dIHdmWcOcjAixo8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Good experience to pick up parts for car repairing, but the best is ask the price before you remove it. At all good price and clean and organized space. They have rims and tires for sale too. Excellent service.\nToday I had a bad experience. I check the price for backlighting of Mazda 3 before remove. Was40$, after I remove they are charging me 80$ cause they are unattached, became 80$ a pair! Same price for a brand new one online. So, was my last time here! Waste of time, pay 5$ remove by yourself and charged as new part!",
        "time": 1737921224,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "O'keefe beer guy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105804639960068928504/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV-N0l-MhWe6R8u8tM7KXxcjySuacDk9h4BAbmaK-OyAKkMfhlxbw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Well it's very small place and not much for cars...and front dude is very slow..  plus the wagons are all broke..parking small. Good side is the price is cheaper then la parire..and it's closer to valleyfeild...that's it.. they even check your tools when you get in?? Lol",
        "time": 1742345456,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
